```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Our Story ❤️</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
            background: #fff7f9;
            color: #4b2733;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* Верхний экран */

        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at top, #ffffff 0%, transparent 45%),
                linear-gradient(160deg, #ffe8ef, #fff7f9);
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 650px;
            animation: appear 1.5s ease;
        }

        .small-heart {
            font-size: 55px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            animation: heartbeat 1.5s infinite;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(48px, 12vw, 82px);
            font-weight: normal;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 20px;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        .scroll {
            margin-top: 60px;
            font-size: 14px;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        /* Основная часть */

        .content {
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 70px 22px;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 45px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: normal;
        }

        .section-title p {
            margin-top: 10px;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        /* Карточки воспоминаний */

        .memory {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 28px;
            padding: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(80, 35, 50, 0.10);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .memory::before {
            content: "♥";
            position: absolute;
            right: 25px;
            top: 15px;
            font-size: 50px;
            opacity: 0.06;
        }

        .date {
            font-size: 14px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            opacity: 0.55;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .memory h3 {
            font-size: 27px;
            font-weight: normal;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .memory p {
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        /* Фото */

        .photo-placeholder {
            height: 280px;
            border-radius: 22px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffdce6, #fff1f5);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #8b5262;
        }

        .photo-placeholder span {
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        /* Финал */

        .final {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 100px 25px;
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, #fff0f4, #ffe1ea);
        }

        .final-heart {
            font-size: 70px;
            animation: heartbeat 1.5s infinite;
        }

        .final h2 {
            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: normal;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .final p {
            max-width: 550px;
            margin: auto;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .back-button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 35px;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            background: #ff6f91;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .back-button:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            font-size: 13px;
            opacity: 0.55;
        }

        @keyframes heartbeat {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: scale(1);
            }

            50% {
                transform: scale(1.15);
            }
        }

        @keyframes appear {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(25px);
            }

            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 52px;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 18px;
            }

            .memory {
                padding: 25px;
            }

            .memory h3 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }

            .photo-placeholder {
                height: 220px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- Первый экран -->

    <section class="hero">

        <div class="hero-content">

            <div class="small-heart">❤️</div>

            <h1>Our Story</h1>

            <p>
                A story about two people,<br>
                unexpected meetings and beautiful memories.
            </p>

            <div class="scroll">
                ↓ Scroll to discover our story
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- История -->

    <main class="content">

        <div class="section-title">

            <h2>Our memories</h2>

            <p>
                Every little moment matters.
            </p>

        </div>


        <!-- Первое воспоминание -->

        <div class="memory">

            <div class="date">
                The beginning
            </div>

            <h3>🌸 The day we met</h3>

            <p>
                Sometimes you meet someone without knowing
                how important that person may become.
                This is where our story began.
            </p>

        </div>


        <!-- Фото -->

        <div class="memory">

            <div class="photo-placeholder">

                <span>
                    📸<br><br>
                    Our first photo
                </span>

            </div>

            <h3>One moment</h3>

            <p>
                A small moment that became
                a part of our story.
            </p>

        </div>


        <!-- Второе воспоминание -->

        <div class="memory">

            <div class="date">
                A memory
            </div>

            <h3>💕 Our time together</h3>

            <p>
                Every conversation, every walk,
                every laugh and every little detail
                became something worth remembering.
            </p>

        </div>


        <!-- Будущее -->

        <div class="memory">

            <div class="date">
                The future
            </div>

            <h3>✨ To be continued...</h3>

            <p>
                Our story is still being written.
                There are many places to see,
                many memories to make,
                and many chapters waiting for us.
            </p>

        </div>

    </main>


    <!-- Финал -->

    <section class="final">

        <div class="final-heart">
            ❤️
        </div>

        <h2>For Marina</h2>

        <p>
            I don't know exactly what the future will bring,
            but I'm grateful that our paths crossed.
            And I'm happy that this story exists.
        </p>

        <a href="index.html" class="back-button">
            ← Back to the beginning
        </a>

    </section>


    <footer>
        Made especially for Marina ❤️
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
```


